<title>GREECE: DIARY - Athens bourse rights issues May-June.</title>
<headline>DIARY - Athens bourse rights issues May-June.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are currently running rights issues by Athens bourse listings.</p>
<p>The table will be updated as new rights issues are cleared by the Athens stock exchange.</p>
<p>    SHARE		    TERMS	  ISSUE	SUBSCRIPTION</p>
<p>						  PRICE	   PERIOD</p>
<p>						(in drs)</p>
<p>Hellenic Techno	  1-for-1	1,400     May 15-June 17</p>
<p>						Proceeds: 7.7 bln</p>
<p>Attica Enterprises     1-for-5	1,550     May</p>
<p>12-June 12</p>
<p>						 Proceeds: 8.1 bln</p>
<p>Sarantis		   1-for-4	2,400     May 12-June 12</p>
<p>						 Proceeds: 3.7 bln</p>
<p>Michaniki		2(c) &amp; 2(p)    1,900(c)  May 09-June 09</p>
<p>-for-10 (c) or (p)  1,400(p)  Proceeds: 11.2 bln --Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
